1.1 "Plugin" means the Aletyx Automation Design plugin identified in the JetBrains Marketplace listing through which you obtained it, including any updates Aletyx makes available through the Marketplace.

1.2 "Aletyx Offerings" means Aletyx software, SaaS, or other offerings that the Plugin is designed to work with, as further described in the applicable Aletyx documentation.

1.3 "Free Features" means the features and functionality of the Plugin that are available to all Users without a paid Aletyx subscription. Free Features are identified in the Documentation.

1.4 "Premium Features" means the features and functionality of the Plugin that require an active, paid subscription to an applicable Aletyx Offering. Premium Features are identified in the Documentation and are gated within the Plugin by subscription validation.

1.5 "User Content" means all decision models, business rules, decision tables, process definitions, workflows, configurations, code, and other materials created or modified by User using the Plugin.

1.6 "Documentation" means the user guides, README files, help documentation, and other technical materials Aletyx makes available for the Plugin.

1.7 "Open Source Components" means third-party software components distributed with the Plugin under separate open source license terms, as identified in the Plugin's NOTICE, LICENSE, or equivalent files.

